MeoArch OS Live

The graphical installer starts automatically on tty1.
For diagnostics and recovery, choose "Diagnostics and repair" from the boot menu.

Network connections are managed by NetworkManager. Use the graphical network
controls when available; from a shell, use nmcli for wired and Wi-Fi networks.

Documentation:
https://github.com/QwQdoge/MeoArch_os-workspace/tree/main/docs
